		{
			id: "if_01_welcome_pity_frame",
			title: "&a&l1. Bio-Tech Foundations: Pity Machine Frame (Phase 0)",
			description: [
				"&7Welcome to the complete master guide for &aIndustrial Foregoing&7—built on one principle: &eif you can farm it, you can automate it&7!",
				"",
				"&6&lCraft the Industrial Foregoing Manual:",
				"&7Combine a &fBook&7, a block of &6Dirt&7, and a piece of &cRedstone&7 to craft the in-game &aIndustrial Foregoing Manual&7, which lists every machine in the order you should build them.",
				"",
				"&6&lThe 4 Machine Frame Tiers in Tech, Scales & Rockets:",
				"&81. &aPity Machine Frame (Phase 0): &7Crafted in a Crafting Table (Osmium, Iron, Logs & Redstone). Unlocks Latex & &fPlastic&7.",
				"&82. &bSimple Machine Frame (Phase 1B): &7Crafted in the Dissolution Chamber (Naga Scales & Carminite). Unlocks crop/animal farms & &dPink Slime&7.",
				"&83. &dAdvanced Machine Frame (Phase 3): &7Crafted in the Dissolution Chamber (Allthemodium, Dragon Blood & Pink Slime). Unlocks the &bStasis Chamber&7 & &aHydroponic Beds&7.",
				"&84. &6Supreme Machine Frame (Phase 4): &7Crafted in the Dissolution Chamber (Vibranium, Desh Plates & Ether Gas). Unlocks the &4Tier 4 Rocket Engine&7, &dTri-Realm Alloy Singularity&7 & &6Ore Laser Base&7!",
				"",
				"&cPack Rules Reminder: &7Infinity Tools/Backpack, Mob Duplicator, Enchantment Factory/Applicator/Extractor, and Meat Feeder are removed to protect the core pillars of the modpack!"
			],
			x: 0.0, y: 0.0,
			size: 1.75,
			shape: "gear",
			dependencies: ["p0_steel_casing"],
			tasks: [ { id: "IFT0000000000001", type: "item", item: "industrialforegoing:machine_frame_pity", count: 2 } ],
			rewards: [
				{ id: "IFR0000000000001", type: "item", item: "industrialforegoing:machine_frame_pity", count: 2 },
				{ id: "IFR0000000000002", type: "xp", xp: 75 }
			]
		},
		{
			id: "if_01b_gui_and_copier",
			title: "&b1B. GUI Side Config & Machine Settings Copier",
			description: [
				"&7Every machine in Industrial Foregoing shares the exact same interface—learn one and you know them all!",
				"",
				"&6&lHow Industrial Foregoing Machines Work:",
				"&8• &bColored Side Squares (Bottom of GUI): &7Each colored square represents an internal tank or inventory. Click a square to highlight that resource and set any side of the machine to &aPush&7, &9Pull&7, or &cDisabled&7—letting machines shove products straight into an adjacent chest or machine without pipes!",
				"&8• &aWork Bar & Redstone Modes: &7The green bar shows the work timer. Use the Redstone button to ignore Redstone, run only with/without a signal, or pulse a single operation.",
				"&8• &dMachine Settings Copier: &7Configure one machine perfectly, &eShift+Click&7 it with the Copier to save its side settings, then &eShift+Click&7 other machines to paste those settings and automatically insert matching add-ons from your inventory! (&eShift+Click the air&7 to reset the tool)."
			],
			x: 0.0, y: -3.0,
			dependencies: ["if_01_welcome_pity_frame"],
			tasks: [ { id: "IFT0000000000002", type: "item", item: "industrialforegoing:machine_settings_copier", count: 1 } ],
			rewards: [
				{ id: "IFR0000000000003", type: "item", item: "minecraft:redstone", count: 4 },
				{ id: "IFR0000000000004", type: "xp", xp: 75 }
			]
		},
		{
			id: "if_02_fluid_extractor",
			title: "&22. Extract Latex: The Fluid Extractor",
			description: [
				"&7The &aFluid Extractor&7 (&findustrialforegoing:fluid_extractor&7) is your first real machine, pulling liquid &fLatex&7 out of any log placed in front of it.",
				"",
				"&ePro Tips for Maximum Latex:",
				"&8• &7Each cycle takes ~5 seconds and slowly strips the log until it breaks.",
				"&8• &7It runs with &ano power at all&7, but supplying FE makes it work &a3x faster&7!",
				"&8• &6Stack Extractors on One Log: &7Point 3 or 4 Fluid Extractors at the exact same log block at once to multiply your Latex output without multiplying log usage! &6Acacia Logs&7 give the highest Latex yield!"
			],
			x: 2.5, y: 0.0,
